  "prefLabel": "Mec 801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 801.01 Purpose.\n\n(a) The purpose of these rules is to:\n\n(1) Establish procedures and guidelines for the voluntary water treatment certification of water treatment technicians in New Hampshire;\n\n(2) Provide the public with a way of recognizing qualified water treatment technicians;\n\n(3) Provide employers with a formal structure to train employees and test their knowledge and skill level; and\n\n(4) Provide water treatment technicians with the knowledge to perform their tasks safely and efficiently.\n\nSource. #13632, eff 7-19-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec800.html"
}
